iv&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Total income tax expense&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;4,216&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e0e0e0;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;14,550&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e0e0e0;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;The accumulated deferred income taxes at Dec. 31, 2025 and 2024 substantially consist of and result from the tax effect of temporary differences related to property.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;Xcel Energy allocates holding company benefits to its direct subsidiaries based on the positive taxable income of each company in the consolidated federal or combined state returns. WGI was allocated tax benefit of $7,694 and $4,299 in 2025 and 2024, respectively, which were treated as capital contributions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:115%"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;In the normal course of business, WGI is subject to various claims from outside parties. In management&#8217;s opinion, the outcome of these matters will not have a material impact on the financial position, results of operations or cash flows of WGI.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DescriptionOfPlantAndOperationsOfRespondentTextblock id="f-14" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;WestGas InterState, Inc. (WGI) owns one pipeline and was formed to transport natural gas in and out of Colorado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DescriptionOfPlantAndOperationsOfRespondentTextblock>
  <ferc:AdditionalInformationOnFieldsWhereTheRespondentOperatesTextblock id="f-15" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;WGI operates an 11 mile interstate transmission gas pipeline extending from Chalk Bluffs Compressor Station in Weld County, Colorado, near the Colorado-Wyoming border to WGI's Paraffin Meadows meter station located in Laramie County, Wyoming, with a certified service capacity of 13,674 Dth of natural gas per day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:AdditionalInformationOnFieldsWhereTheRespondentOperatesTextblock>
  <ferc:DetailsOfAnyChangesOfScopeInRespondentsOperationsTextblock id="f-16" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;Not applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DetailsOfAnyChangesOfScopeInRespondentsOperationsTextblock>
